# Admin form standards

When building or updating admin **create**, **edit**, or **view** flows, follow the team-roles reference (`TeamRoleForm`, `ViewTeamRoleDetail`).

## Page shell
- Use `AdminPage` with `hideDescription` on create/edit (no lede under title).
- Register sub-routes in `src/lib/admin-menu.ts` (`ADMIN_HEADER_ROUTE_RULES`) so the header title is dynamic (e.g. "Create a role", "Edit role", "View role") — not "Dashboard".
- Add matching keys under `admin.header.pages` in EN/HI i18n.

## Create + edit form (one component)
- Single form component with optional edit prop (e.g. `editValue?: string`); delete separate create/edit files.
- Form class: `admin-create-form` (+ domain class e.g. `admin-role-form`).
- Use responsive grids: `admin-form-grid admin-form-grid--2` / `--3` for 2–3 fields per row; full-width fields use `admin-form-grid__full`.
- Simple forms (e.g. roles) can use a single `--2` row for all fields on one line.
- Use `AdminFormField` for text inputs — do not hand-roll label/input/error markup.
- Use `AdminImageUpload` for photos — pass `constraints` (`accept`, `maxSizeBytes`) and `labels` via `buildAdminImageUploadLabels()` (`drop`, `browse`, `change`, `remove`, `hint`).
- Empty initial values; placeholders like "Enter a role title" (EN/HI i18n).
- No hint text under fields.

## Labels & buttons
- Field labels: title case, **not** ALL CAPS (`text-transform: none` on view `dt`; create uses `AdminFieldLabel`).
- Required fields: red `*` via `AdminFieldLabel`; label color stays navy on error.
- Actions: **Cancel** + submit only. Normal case (no uppercase buttons).
- Submit label: **Save** (create), **Update** (edit). Saving: "Saving…" / "Updating…".
- **Cancel** always returns to the **listing page** (`router.push` + `type="button"`), not view/detail.

## Validation
- Live validation each render from `validate*` helpers — avoid stale `errors` state.
- Per-field `touchedFields`: show errors only for fields the user touched (or after submit touches all).
- Save/Update **disabled** until the form is fully valid.
- Show red border + error text below field when invalid (including required: "This field is required.").
- Do not leak errors across fields (typing in field A must not show errors on field B).

## View / detail page
- Field labels match create/edit styling (title case, not uppercase).
- Secondary action: **Cancel** (not "Back to …") → listing page.
- Primary action: **Edit …** (or domain equivalent).

## i18n
- Separate namespaces for create, edit, view under `admin.company.*` (or domain equivalent).
- Include: `fields`, `placeholders`, `save`/`saving`, `cancelAction`, `errors.*`, `success.*`.

## Shared components (reuse, do not duplicate)
- `AdminFormField`, `AdminFormTextarea`, `AdminFieldLabel`, `AdminFieldError`, `AdminImageUpload`, `AdminPhoneField`
- Validation helpers in `src/lib/validations/`
- `shouldShowFieldErrorMessage` in `src/lib/validations/common.ts`
